	"notes": [
		"Observation value = clamp(raw / scale, -4, 4); the network then subtracts its stored mean and divides by its stored std.",
		"Mob frame: x to the mob right, y up, z along the body yaw. Positions are relative to the mob eye; velocities are per tick.",
		"Rays: h = 16 horizontal at eye height, 22.5 degrees apart clockwise from ahead; d = 8 straight down from a ring of radius 1 at the feet; u = 4 straight up from a ring of radius 0.4 at the eye; diag = 4 at 45 degrees up, 90 degrees apart. Raw value = blocks to the first solid block, capped at 16.",
		"Hidden target: target.visible and the last-seen fields (rel_x, rel_y, rel_z, ticks_since_seen) are set; every other target field is 0.",
		"Ally slots are 0 until a group fight fills them.",
		"Action: forward and strafe in [-1, 1] (strafe > 0 is to the right); yaw and pitch are turn rates in [-1, 1] scaled by 30 degrees per tick (yaw > 0 turns right, pitch > 0 looks down).",
		"Network output: 4 continuous values (tanh at run time), then 2 jump logits, then 4 bow logits (idle, draw, release, volley); the discrete heads take the arg max."
	],
